{"seq":2,"slug":"behavior-tree-anatomy","title":"行为树解剖：tick 机制与数据流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/foundations/behavior-tree-anatomy","wordCount":717,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"行为树解剖-tick-机制与数据流\">行为树解剖：tick 机制与数据流</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>行为树的运行时机制围绕一个核心操作：<strong>tick</strong>。游戏主循环每帧（或按固定频率）对 BT 根节点调用一次 tick，节点依据内部逻辑处理后返回三种状态之一，控制流在树中传播。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Root([根节点\\ntick]) --&gt; S1[Selector]&#10;    S1 --&gt; S2[Sequence\\n战斗优先]&#10;    S1 --&gt; S3[Sequence\\n巡逻]&#10;    S2 --&gt; C1{条件\\n看到敌人?}&#10;    S2 --&gt; A1[行动\\n移动到攻击位]&#10;    S2 --&gt; A2[行动\\n攻击]&#10;    S3 --&gt; A3[行动\\n巡逻路点]&#10;    C1 -- Success --&gt; A1&#10;    C1 -- Failure --&gt; S3\">flowchart TD\n    Root([根节点\\ntick]) --&gt; S1[Selector]\n    S1 --&gt; S2[Sequence\\n战斗优先]\n    S1 --&gt; S3[Sequence\\n巡逻]\n    S2 --&gt; C1{条件\\n看到敌人?}\n    S2 --&gt; A1[行动\\n移动到攻击位]\n    S2 --&gt; A2[行动\\n攻击]\n    S3 --&gt; A3[行动\\n巡逻路点]\n    C1 -- Success --&gt; A1\n    C1 -- Failure --&gt; S3</pre><p><strong>三种返回状态</strong>的语义是整个 BT 系统的基石：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>SUCCESS</code></td>\n<td>节点完成，结果成功</td>\n<td>条件满足 / 行动完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>FAILURE</code></td>\n<td>节点完成，结果失败</td>\n<td>条件不满足 / 行动无法执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>RUNNING</code></td>\n<td>节点仍在执行中</td>\n<td>异步行动未完成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"树遍历算法与时序\">树遍历算法与时序</h2><p>BT 的遍历是<strong>深度优先</strong>的：每次 tick 从根节点开始，按照节点类型的语义递归向下，直到叶节点执行实际逻辑后返回，结果向上传播。</p>\n<p><strong>关键设计决策：每帧从根节点重新遍历 vs 记录运行中节点</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"策略 A：每帧从根节点开始完整遍历&#10;  优点：逻辑简单，状态一致性好&#10;  缺点：每帧都要评估高层 Condition 节点，计算开销较高&#10;  适用：行为树较小（&lt;50 节点）或更新频率较低&#10;&#10;策略 B：记录上次 RUNNING 的节点，下帧直接恢复&#10;  优点：跳过已经确定的上层节点，性能更好&#10;  缺点：需要处理「打断」逻辑（有更高优先级行为出现时如何中止 RUNNING 节点）&#10;  适用：生产游戏的主流选择，需配合 Abort 机制\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>策略 A：每帧从根节点开始完整遍历</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  优点：逻辑简单，状态一致性好</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  缺点：每帧都要评估高层 Condition 节点，计算开销较高</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  适用：行为树较小（&#x3C;50 节点）或更新频率较低</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>策略 B：记录上次 RUNNING 的节点，下帧直接恢复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  优点：跳过已经确定的上层节点，性能更好</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  缺点：需要处理「打断」逻辑（有更高优先级行为出现时如何中止 RUNNING 节点）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  适用：生产游戏的主流选择，需配合 Abort 机制</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>RUNNING 状态的生命周期</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class BehaviorTree {&#10;  private runningNode: BTNode | null = null;&#10;&#10;  tick(blackboard: Blackboard): NodeStatus {&#10;    if (this.runningNode) {&#10;      // 直接恢复 RUNNING 节点&#10;      const status = this.runningNode.tick(blackboard);&#10;      if (status !== NodeStatus.RUNNING) {&#10;        this.runningNode = null;&#10;      }&#10;      return status;&#10;    }&#10;    return this.root.tick(blackboard);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BehaviorTree</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> runningNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BTNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">blackboard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Blackboard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NodeStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.runningNode) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 直接恢复 RUNNING 节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.runningNode.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NodeStatus.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">RUNNING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.runningNode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> status;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.root.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"tick-数据流与-blackboard-交互\">tick 数据流与 Blackboard 交互</h2><p>叶节点的 Condition 和 Action 通过 Blackboard（共享内存）读写数据，不直接持有游戏状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class ConditionIsInRange implements BTNode {&#10;  constructor(&#10;    private readonly targetKey: string,&#10;    private readonly maxDistance: number,&#10;  ) {}&#10;&#10;  tick(blackboard: Blackboard): NodeStatus {&#10;    const target = blackboard.get&lt;Vector3&gt;(this.targetKey);&#10;    if (!target) return NodeStatus.FAILURE;&#10;&#10;    const self = blackboard.get&lt;Vector3&gt;(&#39;self_position&#39;);&#10;    const dist = Vector3.distance(self!, target);&#10;    return dist &lt;= this.maxDistance ? NodeStatus.SUCCESS : NodeStatus.FAILURE;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class ActionMoveTo implements BTNode {&#10;  private navAgent: NavAgent | null = null;&#10;&#10;  tick(blackboard: Blackboard): NodeStatus {&#10;    const target = blackboard.get&lt;Vector3&gt;(&#39;target_position&#39;);&#10;    if (!target) return NodeStatus.FAILURE;&#10;&#10;    if (!this.navAgent) {&#10;      const entity = blackboard.get&lt;Entity&gt;(&#39;self_entity&#39;)!;&#10;      this.navAgent = entity.getComponent(NavAgent);&#10;      this.navAgent.moveTo(target);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (this.navAgent.hasReached()) {&#10;      this.navAgent = null;&#10;      return NodeStatus.SUCCESS;&#10;    }&#10;    return NodeStatus.RUNNING;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  onAbort(): void {&#10;    this.navAgent?.stop();&#10;    this.navAgent = null;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConditionIsInRange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BTNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> targetKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> maxDistance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  tick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">blackboard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Blackboard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NodeStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blackboard.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Vector3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.targetKey);</span></sp